  <name>draft0</name>
  <summary>A minimal editor for markdown and Fountain screenplays</summary>
  <description>
    <p>
      draft0 is a distraction-free editor for markdown and Fountain screenplays, built on the MarkText editor engine.
    </p>
    <p>Features:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Realtime preview (WYSIWYG) and a clean, minimal interface</li>
      <li>Fountain screenplay editing with a live, correctly-formatted preview</li>
      <li>GitHub Flavored Markdown like task-lists, tables, links and emojis</li>
      <li>Markdown extensions such as math expressions (KaTeX) and front matter</li>
      <li>Code fence for all the popular languages</li>
      <li>Export to HTML and PDF in the theme and fonts you write in</li>
      <li>Various edit modes and themes: source code mode, typewriter mode, focus mode</li>
    </ul>
  </description>
  <categories>
    <category>Utility</category>
    <category>TextEditor</category>
  </categories>
